%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e9620f8c34305754d8cc9a7e49e852d9, type: 3}
  m_Name: Dialogue_en
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.Localization::UnityEngine.Localization.Tables.StringTable
  m_LocaleId:
    m_Code: en
  m_SharedData: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 307a777c1a3e2004bbee95f62ad7e4f4, type: 2}
  m_Metadata:
    m_Items: []
  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 2054229012480
    m_Localized: Can't sleep?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2054308704256
    m_Localized: Of course you can't.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2054308704257
    m_Localized: Well, since we're both awake, I might as well tell you something.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2054308704258
    m_Localized: If you hear scratching beneath the bed, don't hide immediately.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2054308704259
    m_Localized: Wait until whatever's under there shows itself.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2054308704260
    m_Localized: Then pull that blanket over your head.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2054308704261
    m_Localized: And if someone comes knocking at the door...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2054308704262
    m_Localized: Don't make a sound when it opens.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2054308704263
    m_Localized: Just hold your breath.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2054308704264
    m_Localized: Oh, and keep that flashlight nearby.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2054308704265
    m_Localized: Something likes looking through your window.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2054308704266
    m_Localized: Shine it in the face if it gets too close.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2054308704267
    m_Localized: And if it leaves the window open, you might want to close it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2054308704268
    m_Localized: Unless you enjoy being surprised.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2054308704269
    m_Localized: Funny, isn't it?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2054308704270
    m_Localized: All these things trying to get to you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2054308704271
    m_Localized: And you're still the one who has to keep yourself alive.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2054312898560
    m_Localized: You're still here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2054312898561
    m_Localized: I suppose that's something.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2054312898562
    m_Localized: You know how they work now, don't you?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2054312898563
    m_Localized: Keep listening.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2054312898564
    m_Localized: Keep watching.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2054312898565
    m_Localized: Don't waste that flashlight.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2054312898566
    m_Localized: And about that window...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2054312898567
    m_Localized: Leaving it open won't make anything go away.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2054312898568
    m_Localized: It just means you won't hear it coming next time.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2054312898569
    m_Localized: Strange how comfortable you've gotten with things that hurt you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2054312898570
    m_Localized: Anyway.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2054312898571
    m_Localized: Try to get through another night.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2054312898572
    m_Localized: Well.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2054312898573
    m_Localized: Would you look at that.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2054312898574
    m_Localized: He's been beside you this whole time.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2054312898575
    m_Localized: Even I thought you'd recognize him sooner.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2054312898576
    m_Localized: Doesn't he look familiar?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2054312898577
    m_Localized: Don't look so surprised.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2054312898578
    m_Localized: You've spent so much time thinking about becoming him.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2054317092864
    m_Localized: Here's the thing.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2054317092865
    m_Localized: He doesn't want to be alone anymore.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2054317092866
    m_Localized: If you feel yourself sinking toward him...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2054317092867
    m_Localized: Look at him.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2054317092868
    m_Localized: Push yourself back up.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2054317092869
    m_Localized: Don't let him pull you down.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2054317092870
    m_Localized: Although...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2054317092871
    m_Localized: Would it really be so terrible to rest?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3632541317148672
    m_Localized: Still here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3632541480726528
    m_Localized: Glass. Colored glass, shaped like a person.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3632541480726529
    m_Localized: It's comforting to look at.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3632541480726530
    m_Localized: The smell is awful, though.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds: []
